9Chain-A1 — third-party notices
================================

9Chain-A1 is a sovereign fork of avalanchego. It keeps the consensus and VM core
unchanged and replaces only the identity layer (client name, token name/symbol,
address HRP, VM ID, network ID, chain ID). See scripts/rebrand.sh for the exact
surface that is changed.

This file lists everything in or around this repository that is NOT covered by
the BSD-3-Clause grant in LICENSE.

