2. coreth and subnet-evm — LGPL-3.0 (and GPL-3.0 for some files)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    upstream/avalanchego/graft/coreth/
    upstream/avalanchego/graft/subnet-evm/

Both contain code derived from go-ethereum and ship COPYING (GPL-3.0),
COPYING.LESSER (LGPL-3.0) and LICENSE files of their own. 9Chain-A1 does not
modify their Go source; the only change in this area is a build-time constant:

    graft/subnet-evm/scripts/constants.sh   VM ID "subnetevm" -> "love9evm"

The L1 EVM plugin distributed in the node image is built from subnet-evm and is
covered by those licenses, not by LICENSE in this repository. Anyone
